<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/900x400" alt="Applied Informatics illustration" class="hero-image">

<p>
Studying Applied Informatics has given me insights into technology that I never had before. Before starting, I thought it was only about coding, but it turned out to be much broader and more structured.
</p>

